From 34885f76d35bc192496ef4efed099df602a915b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:59:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 077/203] nvec: report the battery and the power supply

Poll the power supply and one battery value every 5 seconds, as Linux
does, and publish the battery with the interface of the ACPI battery
driver, so that PowerStatus can show it.
---
 src/add-ons/kernel/busses/i2c/nvec/Jamfile  |   2 +-
 src/add-ons/kernel/busses/i2c/nvec/nvec.cpp | 276 +++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 273 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

